            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "\n    \n    <div class=\"screening-group mb-12 md:mb-16\">\n        <div class=\"mb-8\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase shrink-0 pb-3\">THU, SEP 3</h2>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"space-y-14\">\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"The Notebook\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/d307de88-5b2c-4417-930c-c51df716cbe8/MV5BMTMxODE3NDQwNl5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMjUxMTg0NA@@._V1_.jpeg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 md:bottom-3 md:right-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded\" style=\"background-color: #ec3694; color: #f9f4ee\">Date Night</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/stratford/screenings/the-notebook-3035\" class=\"hover:underline\">The Notebook</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Thu, Sep 3</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>7:30 PM</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>6:30 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Stratford, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">BEHIND EVERY GREAT LOVE IS A GREAT STORY.\n\nAn epic love story centered around an older man who reads aloud to a woman with Alzheimer’s. From a faded notebook, the old man’s words bring to life the story about a couple who is separated by World War II, and is then passionately reunited, seven years later, after they have taken different paths.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"9f69ffde-1a0f-4351-9443-acfe8ace4feb\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"9f69ffde-1a0f-4351-9443-acfe8ace4feb\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>7:30 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"screening-group mb-12 md:mb-16\">\n        <div class=\"mb-8\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase shrink-0 pb-3\">FRI, SEP 4</h2>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"space-y-14\">\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Before Sunrise\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/5d927eb3-d9d3-46cb-ba08-bbfca0c82ba7/before.jpeg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 md:bottom-3 md:right-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded\" style=\"background-color: #ec3694; color: #f9f4ee\">Date Night</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/stratford/screenings/before-sunrise-3004\" class=\"hover:underline\">Before Sunrise</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Fri, Sep 4</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>6:00 PM</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>5:00 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Stratford, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">CAN THE GREATEST ROMANCE OF YOUR LIFE LAST ONLY ONE NIGHT?\nOn his way to Vienna, American Jesse meets Céline, a student returning to Paris. After long conversations forge a surprising connection between them, Jesse convinces Celine to get off the train with him in Vienna. Since his flight to the U.S. departs the next morning and he has no money for lodging, they wander the city together, taking in the experiences of Vienna and each other.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"0a617186-2a8c-4e67-82cc-b367835c1e4c\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"0a617186-2a8c-4e67-82cc-b367835c1e4c\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>6:00 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Trainspotting\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/58095b2a-1e56-46f4-a11f-20bf525e082e/trainspotting.jpeg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 md:bottom-3 md:right-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/stratford/screenings/trainspotting-3005\" class=\"hover:underline\">Trainspotting</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Fri, Sep 4</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>8:30 PM</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>8:00 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Stratford, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">CHOOSE LIFE.\r\n\r\nMark Renton, deeply immersed in the Edinburgh drug scene, tries to clean up and get out, despite the allure of the drugs and influence of friends.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"7fd8e629-eb8f-498b-b392-6a8e8fa43b19\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 