\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Door Time</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">45 mins</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Date</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">Sun, Aug 23</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Time</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">4:10 PM</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Year</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">2009</div>\n            \n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rounded-2xl p-10 text-brand-navy/80\">\n        \n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-8\">\n\n        <div class=\"md:hidden relative\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_400,h_300,c_fill,g_xy_center,x_1024,y_683,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/1604efe3-f9be-4027-b103-e72682ebf464/MV5BMTcwMTcwNzgyMV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzgzNDIzMw@@._V1_.jpg\" alt=\"Stratford, London outdoor screening of MV5BMTcwMTcwNzgyMV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzgzNDIzMw@@._V1_.jpg in London\" class=\"w-[45%] aspect-[4/3] object-cover rounded-xl relative z-10 -ml-4 shadow-lg\">\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-brand-navy text-brand-white rounded-2xl p-5 pt-10 -mt-6 relative z-0\">\n                <div class=\"prose prose-invert prose-sm leading-relaxed max-w-none\">\n                    THIS IS NOT A LOVE STORY. THIS IS A STORY ABOUT LOVE.\n\nTom, greeting-card writer and hopeless romantic, is caught completely off-guard when his girlfriend, Summer, suddenly dumps him. He reflects on their 500 days together to try to figure out where their love affair went sour, and in doing so, Tom rediscovers his true passions in life.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex relative flex-row items-center gap-0 min-h-[350px]\">\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-brand-navy text-brand-white rounded-2xl p-10 w-1/2 z-10 relative -mr-12 shadow-2xl\">\n                <div class=\"prose prose-invert prose-lg leading-relaxed max-w-none\">\n                    THIS IS NOT A LOVE STORY. THIS IS A STORY ABOUT LOVE.\n\nTom, greeting-card writer and hopeless romantic, is caught completely off-guard when his girlfriend, Summer, suddenly dumps him. He reflects on their 500 days together to try to figure out where their love affair went sour, and in doing so, Tom rediscovers his true passions in life.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n\n            <div class=\"w-1/2 z-0\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_900,h_450,c_fill,g_xy_center,x_1024,y_683,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/1604efe3-f9be-4027-b103-e72682ebf464/MV5BMTcwMTcwNzgyMV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzgzNDIzMw@@._V1_.jpg\" alt=\"Stratford, London outdoor screening of MV5BMTcwMTcwNzgyMV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzgzNDIzMw@@._V1_.jpg in London\" class=\"w-full h-[450px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-inner\">\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n   